# Claude Code local wiring
# .claude/skills/govern-capstone-work is a filesystem junction to
# .agents/skills/govern-capstone-work. Git resolves it and would commit the same
# files twice, so ignore the mirror and keep .agents/ as the tracked source.
.claude/skills/govern-capstone-work/

